msgid "Piii... piii... piii... <wait(0.9)><wait(0.9)><$motion(3,939)>¡Pam!"
msgstr ""

#. en: <$voicel(3,7)><$comeff(3,3)><$motion(3,1141)>Looks like the <$cdef(27)>mood</color>’s sittin’ around <$cdef(27)><mood;0></color> right now.
